  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "プラターヌはかせから\nママあてに　かかれた　てがみ。\nほんのり　いい　かおりがする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "플라타느박사가\n엄마에게 쓴 편지.\n은은하게 좋은 향기가 난다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une lettre du Professeur Platane à Maman.\nElle dégage un parfum subtil.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein an deine Mutter adressierter Brief von\nProfessor Platan. Ihm haftet ein schwacher\nParfümduft an.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una de las misteriosas Megapiedras. Permite\nmegaevolucionar a Blastoise en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lettera del Professor Platan per la mamma.\nEmana un delicato profumo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A letter that Professor Sycamore wrote\nto your mother. A faint but pleasant\nperfume seems to cling to the paper.",
